<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS2" title="In V-B Evaluation of Semantic Correctness ‣ V Evaluation ‣ SPAR: Scalable LLM-based PDDL Domain Generation for Aerial Robotics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-B</span>2 </span>Feasibility and Interpretability</span></a></li>
